[19.674673, "o", "\r\n"]
[46.666254, "o", "\r\nHere is the prioritised audit report for the charm, based on Canonical's best practices.\r\n\r\n🔴 **Priority 1: Code Quality & Testing (Must Fix)**\r\n* **Dead Configuration:** The `log-level` config option is declared in `charmcraft.yaml` but never actually read or used in `src/charm.py`.\r\n* **Zero Test Coverage:** The charm lacks both unit (`tests/unit/`) and integration (`tests/integration/`) tests. \r\n* **Blind Misconfigurations:** The charm does not use `BlockedStatus` for missing relations or invalid configuration, meaning operators won't be explicitly warned when the charm cannot function.\r\n\r\n🟠 **Priority 2: Observability & Operations (Should Fix)**\r\n* **No COS Integration:** The charm is missing all standard observability relations (`metrics-endpoint`, `logging`, `grafana-dashboard`, and `tracing`).\r\n* **Missing Tracing Instrumentation:** The `ops-tracing` library is not wired in.\r\n* **Missing Standard Actions:** Common day-2 operational actions (`get-health`, `pause`, `resume`) are missing.\r\n* **No TLS Support:** No encryption or TLS interfaces are detected.\r\n\r\n🟡 **Priority 3: Metadata & Charmhub Readiness (Nice to Have / Pre-Publishing)**\r\n* **Missing Documentation:** No `README.md`, usage guides, or troubleshooting docs exist.\r\n* **Incomplete Metadata:** `charmcraft.yaml` lacks essential fields like `display-name`, `description`, and repository links (`docs`, `issues`, `source`).\r\n* **Missing Assets:** No `LICENSE` or `icon.svg` found for the Charmhub listing. \r\n\r\nLet me know which area you'd like to tackle first when you're ready!\r\n"]
[48.86346, "o", "\u001b[2;37m# \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2;37m# From here cantrip would queue fix tasks, branch, and apply them\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2;37m# in disposable subagents. Gate every step with /tasks confirm.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
